13	  </main></div>
14	  <dialog id="dialog"><div class="modal"><h2>Edit bookmark</h2><p class="sub">Make this bookmark easier to recognize later.</p><label for="title">Title</label><input id="title" value="My PARA reference"><label for="desc">Description</label><textarea id="desc">A simple, comprehensive system for organizing any type of digital information across any platform.</textarea><div class="actions"><button class="secondary" id="cancel">Cancel</button><button class="primary" id="save">Save changes</button></div></div></dialog><div class="toast" id="toast">Changes saved</div>
